m:agent="v1" begin="00:33.990" end="00:37.030">'Cause that ass on that bad bitch is fat as a bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.030" end="00:39.920">Bling-bling-blow, he like, "What's that on your wrist?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.920" end="00:42.770">Bling-bling-blow, that's all them platinum hits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.770" end="00:45.320">Bling-bling-blow, that's all that Billboard shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.320" end="00:48.730">Just that big boy, used to bump that André and that Big Boi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.730" end="00:51.540">Small change, turn them small pieces into big boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.540" end="00:54.330">Blicky make a nigga sit the fuck up like a big boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.330" end="00:57.290">Small change, turn them small pieces into big boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.290" end="01:00.090">Blicky make a nigga sit the fuck up like a big boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.090" end="01:02.890">Small change, turn them small pieces into big boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.890" end="01:05.760">Blicky make a nigga sit the fuck up like a big boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.760" end="01:08.560">Small change, turn them small pieces into big boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.560" end="01:11.130">Roll up on it (yuh), pimpin' like C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.130" end="01:13.940">I was brought up on it (yes, sir), niggas mad at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.940" end="01:16.340">Throwin' salt up on it (hatin' ass nigga), pussy good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.340" end="01:19.620">But please don't get caught up on it (nah), I don't really blame him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.620" end="01:22.770">'Cause that ass on that bad bitch is fat as a bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.770" end="01:25.780">Bling-bling-blow, he like, "What's that on your wrist?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.780" end="01:28.600">Bling-bling-blow, that